        "label": "Asynchronous Timesheet Engine",
        "focus": ["api", "services", "redis", "worker", "storage", "smtp"],
        "note": "Heavy timesheet exports are enqueued to Redis Asynq, processed by workers with Excelize v2, saved to S3, and delivered via SMTP."
      },
